（injective），见《叠（Stacks）的性质（Properties）》，引理（Lemma）<REF_0009>。\n由《叠（Stacks）的性质（Properties）》，引理（Lemma）<REF_0010>可知<MATH_0030>是满射（surjective），这蕴含（根据我们对<MATH_0031>的选取）<MATH_0032>的像（image）为<MATH_0033>。\n我们得出<MATH_0034>是一个单点集（singleton）。\n最后，由构造，<MATH_0035>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）且既约（reduced）的，即<MATH_0036>是既约（reduced）且局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的。这意味着<MATH_0037>的本质（essential）像（image）是<MATH_0038>在<MATH_0039>处的剩余格尔布（residual gerbe），见《叠（Stacks）的性质（Properties）》，引理（Lemma）<REF_0011>。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:a7ac7dbb69dcf652b239312d60c1ae8c96b9b66adfb63e67ec7b33ce26c57682", "unit_id": "tag:06UI:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所选取的覆盖空间的类型；所供词表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "覆盖态射、投影及点集映射的满射性质。", "source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"context": "覆盖态射和基变换所得态射的平坦性质。", "source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"context": "原文 locally finite presented 中所要求保留的词形。", "source_term": "locally finite", "target_term": "局部有限"}, {"context": "覆盖态射及后续态射的局部拟有限性质。", "source_term": "locally quasi-finite", "target_term": "局部拟有限"}, {"context": "证明中的态射，包括用于基变换的原来的态射。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "所引用结果的类型。", "source_term": "Theorem", "target_term": "定理"}, {"context": "纤维积的两个投影。", "source_term": "projections", "target_term": "投影"}, {"context": "覆盖和群胚结构态射的有限表示条件。", "source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"context": "投影由原态射作基变换得到。", "source_term": "base changes", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"context": "证明所用的典范构造给出的态射。", "source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"context": "引用的章节标题。", "source_term": "Algebraic Stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "所引用结果的类型。", "source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}, {"context": "典范态射的等价性质。", "source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "所引用结果的类型。", "source_term": "Remark", "target_term": "注记"}, {"context": "代数空间中的群胚表示。", "source_term": "groupoid", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "群胚所属的范畴。",